# ================================================================
# HCLTECH KRONOS + LoRA COMPLETE PIPELINE
# ================================================================
#
# What this script does:
#
# 1. Automatically finds HCLTECH Parquet files
# 2. Loads old + newer HCLTECH data when available
# 3. Converts minute data to daily OHLCV if necessary
# 4. Cleans and merges duplicate dates
# 5. Uses 400 trading days as Kronos context
# 6. Loads pretrained Kronos-small + tokenizer
# 7. Adds custom LoRA adapters to Kronos transformer Linear layers
# 8. Freezes original Kronos weights
# 9. Trains only LoRA parameters
# 10. Uses validation loss for automatic early stopping
# 11. Saves BEST LoRA weights
# 12. Generates Kronos prediction
# 13. Calculates naive baseline
# 14. Calculates divergence
# 15. Calculates MAE / RMSE / MAPE
# 16. Creates interactive Plotly HTML dashboard
#
# Output:
#
# ~/yatin/hcltech_lora/
#
#     best_lora_weights.pt
#     final_lora_weights.pt
#     training_history.csv
#     predictions.csv
#     kronos_hcltech_dashboard.html
#
# ================================================================


